    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/85e34ad6f94d12133f607bd2b7fcde4b.poster.avif?t=1747257062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/85e34ad6f94d12133f607bd2b7fcde4b.webm?t=1747257062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/85e34ad6f94d12133f607bd2b7fcde4b.mp4?t=1747257062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, farm, hunt, explore and fight to survive on lush procedural islands in Hexiv!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use cards to move, attack, provide tasks for your crew, expand your territory,  and construct buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore ruins and purchase upgrades in the Research Lab to acquire artifacts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Refuel your Lander and hop to new islands, journeying towards the final showdown at the planet's equator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/28376bb115d7fdd04feff2778df4ca12.poster.avif?t=1747257062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/28376bb115d7fdd04feff2778df4ca12.webm?t=1747257062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/28376bb115d7fdd04feff2778df4ca12.mp4?t=1747257062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful and dynamic pixel perfect pixel art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Chapters with customizable difficulty modifiers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural islands with different biome, wildlife, and varied topography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ upgradeable artifacts which grant unique game modifiers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ cards you can buy from the Trader or acquire from building actions or combat spoils!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen unique crew you can unlock, each with their own passives and quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 landers with unique mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades in the research laboratory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of enemy tiles and units intent on stopping you and terraforming the planet into a frozen wasteland!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radishes!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/85e34ad6f94d12133f607bd2b7fcde4b.poster.avif?t=1747257062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/85e34ad6f94d12133f607bd2b7fcde4b.webm?t=1747257062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/85e34ad6f94d12133f607bd2b7fcde4b.mp4?t=1747257062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, farm, hunt, explore and fight to survive on lush procedural islands in Hexiv!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use cards to move, attack, provide tasks for your crew, expand your territory,  and construct buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore ruins and purchase upgrades in the Research Lab to acquire artifacts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Refuel your Lander and hop to new islands, journeying towards the final showdown at the planet's equator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/28376bb115d7fdd04feff2778df4ca12.poster.avif?t=1747257062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/28376bb115d7fdd04feff2778df4ca12.webm?t=1747257062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/28376bb115d7fdd04feff2778df4ca12.mp4?t=1747257062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful and dynamic pixel perfect pixel art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Chapters with customizable difficulty modifiers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural islands with different biome, wildlife, and varied topography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ upgradeable artifacts which grant unique game modifiers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ cards you can buy from the Trader or acquire from building actions or combat spoils!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen unique crew you can unlock, each with their own passives and quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 landers with unique mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades in the research laboratory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of enemy tiles and units intent on stopping you and terraforming the planet into a frozen wasteland!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radishes!</p>",
    "short_description": "Hexiv is a strategy deckbuilder about surviving on a lush but hostile planet. Use cards to build, explore, expand and feed your crew while battling a determined adversary to unlock the mysteries of this genre-blending roguelike!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
